    "content" : "Θ(ω,x) := (σω,Tω0(x)). Here σ is the left shift operator σω := (ωi+1)i∈N. With a slight abuse of notation we write Tωn(x) := Tωn−1 ◦ ··· ◦ Tω0(x)"
